  "findings": [
    "Staggered cups retains blue-grey thick exterior and pink inner section, with a visibly usable staggered opening and warm substrate. Does not approve areas outside lamp.",
    "Split tows has lit pink longitudinal strands, visible uneven torn ends and blue ground; the intermediate low bed allows a discernible change of side.",
    "Pitch forks has differently sized folded arms and a thick head, dark outer skin versus pale inner section. Routes are evidenced separately by actual body tests.",
    "Curled-flats low sheets read as polygon overlays: long straight black seam traverses the open bed, pointed triangle end and straight right cut are too geometric and disconnected. Three high curls are not the target of this rejection. A low settled-sheet variant is being tested; not yet accepted."
  ],
